---
import { m } from '../../../data/recruitment-media';
---
<section aria-label="Design solutions" style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; background: #F7F7F4; color: #251F19; font-family: var(--font-text); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;">
  <div style="box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: calc(1280px + 2 * var(--gutter)); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px) var(--gutter); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);">

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
      <span style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--brand);">Design solutions</span>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #251F19;">Principles that shaped every screen</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #68615A;">Learn it once, and every screen feels familiar.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
      <article class="big" style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: clamp(20px, 3.4vw, 44px); border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4;">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 34px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: #251F19;">Table-first approach</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #68615A;">One mental model, reused across every management module. Tenant, User and Candidate views share the same pattern: learn it once, and every screen feels familiar.</p>
          <div role="tablist" aria-label="Compare tables" style="align-self: flex-start; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; padding: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: #EEEDE6;">
            <button class="segbtn" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-seg="tenants" style="min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">Tenants</button>
              <button class="segbtn" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-seg="users" style="min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">Users</button>
              <button class="segbtn" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-seg="candidates" style="min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 18px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">Candidates</button>
          </div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #68615A;">Switch views: the columns, filters and actions stay in the same place.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: clamp(12px, 2vw, 24px); border-radius: var(--radius-card); border: 1px solid #EBE8E4; background-color: #FBFBF9; background-image: radial-gradient(#D6CFC7 1.2px, transparent 1.2px); background-size: 14px 14px;">
          <img src={m('d31b5618a51274c6744e0f42fd4e3e9d')} alt="All Units table with sortable columns and status on the right" data-seg-img="tenants" hidden style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 2 / 1; object-fit: cover; object-position: left top; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #D3E0EF; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(10,44,85,0.14); background: #FFFFFF;">
          <img src={m('f87a463b8e7bf83fd5120dc6a52e8093')} alt="All In-House Users table with the same columns, filters and actions pattern" data-seg-img="users" hidden style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 2 / 1; object-fit: cover; object-position: left top; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #D3E0EF; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(10,44,85,0.14); background: #FFFFFF;">
          <img src={m('416cb73ecd3f3f9c7d565d32c98f5d57')} alt="Candidate table with status, stage, owner and chat columns in the same table pattern" data-seg-img="candidates" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 2 / 1; object-fit: cover; object-position: left top; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #D3E0EF; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(10,44,85,0.14); background: #FFFFFF;">
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="smalls">
        <article style="box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: var(--radius-card); background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; overflow: hidden; background-color: #FBFBF9; background-image: radial-gradient(#D6CFC7 1.2px, transparent 1.2px); background-size: 14px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EBE8E4;">
            <img src={m('7104f36091196e0af3d5c4401a92d996')} alt="Create JD Layout builder with a Sections and Fields panel beside the Job Details form" style="position: absolute; left: 10%; top: 14%; width: 130%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #D3E0EF; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(10,44,85,0.16); display: block; background: #FFFFFF; object-fit: cover; object-position: center center;">
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 22px 24px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
            <h4 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #251F19;">Layout templates</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #68615A;">Step-by-step creation with templates, auto-fill and validation reduces cognitive load without sacrificing control.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article style="box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: var(--radius-card); background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; overflow: hidden; background-color: #FBFBF9; background-image: radial-gradient(#D6CFC7 1.2px, transparent 1.2px); background-size: 14px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EBE8E4;">
            <img src={m('33981246f96909f0708fce47740448e1')} alt="Business Admin side menu with labelled modules" style="position: absolute; left: 12%; top: 10%; width: 76%; height: 100%; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #D3E0EF; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(10,44,85,0.16); display: block; background: #FFFFFF; object-fit: cover; object-position: left top;">
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 22px 24px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
            <h4 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #251F19;">Progressive menu bar</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #68615A;">An expandable side menu gives quick movement across the platform, and each persona gets a menu tailored to their role.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article style="box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: var(--radius-card); background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EBE8E4; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; overflow: hidden; background-color: #FBFBF9; background-image: radial-gradient(#D6CFC7 1.2px, transparent 1.2px); background-size: 14px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EBE8E4;">
            <img src={m('64d12dd68f08eab7439aa788523e1575')} alt="Settings page with Role and Permissions, and Hiring Projects permission toggles" style="position: absolute; left: 10%; top: 14%; width: 130%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #D3E0EF; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(10,44,85,0.16); display: block; background: #FFFFFF; object-fit: cover; object-position: left top;">
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 22px 24px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
            <h4 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; color: #251F19;">Master settings</h4>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #68615A;">Settings are centralized at the source, keeping the system lean and the UX consistent across all 5 roles.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.big{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,4fr) minmax(0,8fr);gap:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);align-items:center}
.smalls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}
.segbtn{cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s ease,color .2s ease}
.segbtn:active{transform:scale(0.98)}
.segbtn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
@media (max-width: 1000px){.big{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.smalls{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
@media (max-width: 640px){.smalls{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
.segbtn{background:transparent;color:#68615A;box-shadow:none}
.segbtn[aria-selected="true"]{background:#FFFFFF;color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(10,44,85,0.12)}
img[hidden]{display:none !important}
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-seg]').forEach((b, _, all) => {
    b.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const id = b.dataset.seg;
      all.forEach((x) => x.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(x === b)));
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-seg-img]').forEach((i) => { i.hidden = i.dataset.segImg !== id; });
    });
  });
</script>
